{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】由於顯示卡價格不斷上升，二手假卡詐騙與造假手法亦不斷演變。</p><p>有顯示卡維修師傅表示，以往二手假卡多數利用舊款晶片打磨改刻來騙人，但至少仍是一顆真正的 GPU；</p><p>惟現時市場上竟已出現僅由玻璃纖維板拼湊、毫無電氣線路的透光「假晶片模型」，手法相當猖獗。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.412579+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T17:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:11.161274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.772276+00:00","content_hash":"a3b6f15fe9cfa79d27bf13ebeaeeb75dad93494a6a6cb54e3009c0c90a175dcf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}